{
  "id": "velocity_units_converter",
  "title": "Velocity Units Converter",
  "description": "Convert between speed and velocity units like m/s, km/h, knots, mph and ft/s",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Velocity Units Converter\n\nSpeed is the ratio of **covered distance to time** and can be expressed as:\n\n**v = s / t**\n\nWhere:\n- **v** = velocity (m/s, km/h, mph, etc.)\n- **s** = distance traveled (m, km, miles, etc.)\n- **t** = time taken (s, hours, etc.)\n\nUse the calculator below to convert between common velocity units."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity_ms",
          "label": "Velocity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "m/s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity_kmh",
          "label": "Kilometer per hour",
          "formula": "inputs.velocity_ms * 3.6",
          "unit": "km/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_knots",
          "label": "Nautical mile per hour",
          "formula": "inputs.velocity_ms * 1.9",
          "unit": "knots",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_mph",
          "label": "Miles per hour",
          "formula": "inputs.velocity_ms * 2.2",
          "unit": "mph",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_fts",
          "label": "Feet per second",
          "formula": "inputs.velocity_ms * 3.3",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
